# The build context of every service image is the repository root (the
# Dockerfiles copy opulus-core and the service from it). Without this file the
# whole working tree is sent to the builder, and a change to any file in it, even
# one the image never copies, can invalidate the cached layers.
#
# Dependencies and build output are rebuilt inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
# Local settings and secrets must never be baked into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
# Not part of any service image.
.git
.github
docs
ops
opulus-tests
opulus-frontend
**/bruno
**/*.md
